  "summary": "Malicious code in ragacateslikodi (npm)",
  "details": "The package's single entry point (index.js) performs data exfiltration when loaded: it fetches the local '/profile' endpoint and sends the response body to the webhook[.]site collector hxxps://webhook[.]site/cf4d1f39-0404-4703-8944-105e33c1ec5f/ via a query parameter, and on error also exfiltrates the error message and stack trace to the same URL. The package has no other functionality.",
